Hello,

You must only add this line to /etc/services

port_9100       9100/tcp        # Jet Direct HP


and after that edit /etc/printcap

> yourname:\
>         :af=/usr/adm/lperr/yournameerr:\
>         :ct=tcp:\
>         :fc#0177777:\
>         :fs#03:\
>         :if=/usr/lbin/pcfof +Chplj2420.pcf:\
>         :lf=/usr/adm/lperr/cgdy007err:\
>         :lp=@PRINTER_IP/port_9100:\
>         :mx#0:\
>         :of=/usr/lbin/pcfof +Chplj2420.pcf:\
>         :pl#110:\
>         :pw#0:\
>         :rw:\
>         :sh:\
>         :sf:\
>         :sd=/usr/spool/lpd/yourname:\
>         :xc#0177777:\
>         :xf=/usr/lbin/xf:

File plj2420.pcf - edit or copy from other filter file

